# Infer: InFact.IndexIntersect
# When: store `x $in index_intersect(I, X, A)`.
# Infers: ambient `x $in X` (and forall fiber; checked via ambient here).
# Run: litex -f examples/infer/atomic/in_index_intersect.lit

have fn A(k {1}) power_set(N) = {1}
forall x index_intersect({1}, N, A):
    x $in N
